this is the .README section of the love seed binary.
love is a self-reproducing programming environment.
this binary contains;
- an interpreter for the love programming language (when invoked as love)
- a compiler for the C programming language (when invoked as cc)
- a self-contained cross-platform GNU-like userland and toolchain
- a compressed copy of its own source code
useful verbs:
- `love source` dump a source tarball
- `love seed` bootstrap an identical seed binary through the ambient C toolchain
- `love cc` `love tar` `love sh` `love make` etc.
